WEBVTT

00:12:29.667 --> 00:12:31.292
it's life changing.

00:12:32.125 --> 00:12:33.643
She closed with,

00:12:33.667 --> 00:12:36.726
"We say our whole passion and purpose

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.601
is to help people be their best,

00:12:38.625 --> 00:12:40.393
to help them be successful.

00:12:40.417 --> 00:12:42.476
But we're hardly giving our best service

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:44.643
by applying this
one-size-fits-all approach

00:12:44.667 --> 00:12:47.143
and just letting people
fall through the cracks.

00:12:47.167 --> 00:12:48.976
We can and we should do better.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.768
There are more Michelles out there,

00:12:50.792 --> 00:12:53.083
and I know because
Michelle is my daughter."

00:12:54.583 --> 00:12:58.309
And in that moment,
the jaws in the room went --

00:12:58.333 --> 00:13:00.018
And someone even wiped away tears,